---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Blog · Blog of Even</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <header class="site-header">
        <a class="brand" href="/">Blog of Even</a>
        <nav>
          <a href="/about">About</a>
          <a href="/blog">Blog</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/wlh64113-cyber">GitHub</a>
        </nav>
      </header>
      <main class="page">
        <p class="eyebrow">Notes & Articles</p>
        <h1>Blog</h1>
        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card">
            <p class="eyebrow">2026-08-21</p>
            <h3>Blog of Even is online</h3>
            <p>GitHub Pages + Astro 的第一版博客已经搭建完成。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <p class="eyebrow">Coming soon</p>
            <h3>Research notes</h3>
            <p>后续可以把科研记录、论文分析和项目总结以 Markdown 文章形式加入这里。</p>
